        "description": [
          {
            "@value": "Ein Musik-Video: Drei Szenarien in einer Komposition. Slocking Walkman ist Sprit. Walkmen liegen bereit zum slocking. Der Slock ist der geile Fisch. Der rote Sprinter greift zum Gerät. Die Tankwärterin setzt an: \"Don't stop – shoot your shot.\" (Divine) (Text: Ursula Pürrer/Ashley Hans Scheirl – Offpride)",
            "@language": "de"
          },
          {
            "@value": "A music video: Three scenarios in one composition. Slocking Walkman is spirit. Walkmen are ready for slocking. The slock is the horny fish. The red sprinter reaches for the device. The gas station attendant starts: \"Don't stop - shoot your shot.\" (Divine) (Text: Ursula Pürrer/Ashley Hans Scheirl – Offpride)",
            "@language": "en"
          }
        ]
      }
